# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-only
# 8353_strap.sm -- Leather strap of the carry handle Keystone 8353
# Copyright (c) 2026 Jakob Kastelic

# A reference solid, not a made part, crude as a block (no drawing):
# the black leather strap, folded flat, 190.5 x 22 x 3 mm, on top of
# the two end mounts (8353_mount.sm) from end to end.  The origin is the
# middle, on the face that the handle mounts on.  Its sizes are within
# 0.25 mm, assumed.
H = 9.5mm +- 0.25mm # The height of the handle over the face, its strap on top
sx = 190.5mm/2 +- 0.25mm
sy = 11mm +- 0.25mm
u0 = -sx
v0 = -sy
u1 = sx
v1 = sy
yt = H
sheet 3mm 0.1mm 0.44
plate k8353_strap u0 v0 u1 v1 at 0 0 yt axes +x +y
round 1mm k8353_strap at u0 v0 yt
round 1mm k8353_strap at u1 v0 yt
round 1mm k8353_strap at u1 v1 yt
round 1mm k8353_strap at u0 v1 yt
